            "title": "Torrid (NYSE:CURV) Misses Q3 CY2025 Revenue Estimates, Stock Drops",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Women\u2019s plus-size apparel retailer Torrid Holdings (NYSE:CURV) missed Wall Street\u2019s revenue expectations in Q3 CY2025, with sales falling 10.8% year on year to $235.2 million. The company\u2019s full-year revenue guidance of $998.5 million at the midpoint came in 2.2% below analysts\u2019 estimates. Its GAAP loss of $0.06 per share was significantly below analysts\u2019 consensus estimates.",
